:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="24.573" end="25.794">Shotgun,</span> <span begin="26.091" end="26.401">aimed</span> <span begin="26.401" end="26.641">at</span> <span begin="26.641" end="26.851">my</span> <span begin="26.851" end="27.241">heart,</span> <span begin="27.241" end="27.601">you</span> <span begin="27.601" end="27.971">got</span> <span begin="27.971" end="28.602">one</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">枪口对准我心 你已上膛</span></p><p begin="28.783" end="31.375" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="28.783" end="29.133">Tear</span> <span begin="29.133" end="29.443">me</span> <span begin="29.443" end="29.943">apart</span> <span begin="29.943" end="30.333">and</span> <span begin="30.333" end="30.598">then</span> <span begin="30.598" end="31.375">some</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">把我撕碎 还嫌不够</span></p><p begin="31.547" end="35.809" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="31.547" end="31.902">How</span> <span begin="31.902" end="32.300">do</span> <span begin="32.300" end="32.490">we</span> <span begin="32.490" end="32.760">call</span> <span begin="32.760" end="33.100">this</span> <span begin="33.100" end="33.950">love?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这也能叫做爱吗</span><span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="34.410" end="35.809"><span begin="34.410" end="34.540">(Whoa,</span> <span begin="34.540" end="34.870">oh-</span><span begin="34.870" end="35.250">oh-</span><span begin="35.250" end="35.809">oh)</span></span></p><p begin="35.835" end="39.681" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="35.835" end="36.235">I</span> <span begin="36.235" end="36.935">tried</span> <span begin="37.061" end="37.431">to</span> <span begin="37.431" end="37.731">run</span> <span begin="37.731" end="38.281">away</span> <span begin="38.281" end="38.651">but</span> <span begin="38.651" end="38.961">your</span> <span begin="38.961" end="39.681">eyes</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我想逃走 可你的眼神</span></p><p begin="39.852" end="42.438" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="39.852" end="40.142">Tell</span> <span begin="40.142" end="40.442">me</span> <span begin="40.442" end="40.672">to</span> <span begin="40.672" end="41.022">stay,</span> <span begin="41.022" end="41.392">oh</span> <span begin="41.392" end="42.438">why</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">却让我留下 为什么</span></p><p begin="42.604" end="46.899" itunes:key="L14" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="42.604" end="42.964">Why</span> <span begin="42.964" end="43.288">do</span> <span begin="43.288" end="43.478">we</span> <span begin="43.478" end="43.808">call</span> <span begin="43.808" end="44.148">this</span> <span begin="44.148" end="45.008">love?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们为何把这叫做爱</span><span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="45.409" end="46.899"><span begin="45.409" end="45.589">(Whoa,</span> <span begin="45.589" end="45.939">oh-</span><span begin="45.939" end="46.269">oh-</span><span begin="46.269" end="46.899">oh)</span></span></p><p begin="47.594" end="51.502" itunes:key="L15" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="47.594" end="48.062">It</span> <span begin="48.062" end="48.532">seems</span> <span begin="48.532" end="48.912">like</span> <span begin="48.912" end="49.262">we&apos;ve</span> <span begin="49.262" end="49.612">been</span> <span begin="49.612" end="50.292">losing</span> <span begin="50.292" end="50.632">con</span><span begin="50.632" end="51.502">trol</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们好像 早已失控</span></p><p begin="52.953" end="58.125" itunes:key="L16" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="52.953" end="54.473">Somebody</span> <span begin="54.473" end="54.803">tell</span> <span begin="54.803" end="55.133">me</span> <span begin="55.133" end="55.483">I&apos;m</span> <span begin="55.483" end="55.843">not</span> <span begin="55.843" end="56.793">alone</span> <span begin="56.825" end="57.055">when</span> <span begin="57.055" end="57.365">I</span> <span begin="5